  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      457.48,
      507.85,
      473.02
    ],
    "text": "25 Suspects Arrested for Illegal Gem Mining \u2013 Walana Anti-Corruption Unit",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      487.6,
      512.92,
      551.38
    ],
    "text": "On 28 July 2026, a team of officers attached to the Walana Anti-Corruption Unit conducted a raid in the Kalu Ganga area of Mawakkumodara, Gankanda, within the Horana Police Division, following a tip-off regarding illegal gem mining activities.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      565.99,
      495.65,
      629.77
    ],
    "text": "During the operation, 25 suspects were arrested for allegedly engaging in unauthorised gem mining in the Kalu Ganga. Police also seized 14 boats, 6 motorcycles, and a quantity of equipment valued at approximately Rs. 70 million, which were allegedly used for the illegal activity.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      644.35,
      522.32,
      675.97
    ],
    "text": "The arrested suspects are residents of the Bandaragama, Horana, Millaniya, and Moronthuduwa areas, and are between 20 and 60 years of age.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      690.55,
      524.59,
      722.17
    ],
    "text": "The suspects, along with the items taken into custody, have been handed over to the Horana Police Station for further legal proceedings.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      736.77,
      523.06,
      784.47
    ],
    "text": "Investigations have revealed that these illegal mining activities had been carried out over an extended period, resulting in significant environmental damage to the surrounding area.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      32.13,
      491.73,
      63.75
    ],
    "text": "Further investigations into the incident are being conducted by the Horana Police Station.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
